  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個 Serilum 模組。滿懷熱忱打造。活躍於 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的眾多模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於這個模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span>「隱藏雙手」是一款極簡風格的<strong>客戶端</strong>可設定模組，能讓你隱藏副手和/或主手。可設定為總是隱藏，或僅在手持特定物品時隱藏。預設情況下，當手持火把或不死圖騰時會隱藏副手，而空手狀態下玩家的手也會被隱藏，除非揮動手臂。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective 模組\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience 整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/client-bundle.svg&w=718\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 客戶端合輯\" width=\"359\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用設定項目：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span><strong>alwaysHideMainHand</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>啟用後將總是隱藏主手。停用時，則僅在手持 hideMainHandWithItems 中定義的物品時隱藏主手。<br><br><span><strong>alwaysHideEmptyMainHand</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：true<br>啟用後，若主手為空將總是隱藏。但空揮時仍會顯示。<br><br><span><strong>hideMainHandWithItems</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：\"\"<br>當 alwaysHideMainHand 停用時，手持此處定義的物品會隱藏主手。<br><br><span><strong>alwaysHideOffhand</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：false<br>啟用後將總是隱藏副手。停用時，則僅在手持 hideOffhandWithItems 中定義的物品時隱藏副手。<br><br><span><strong>hideOffhandWithItems</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值：\"minecraft:totem_of_undying,minecraft:torch\"<br>當 alwaysHideOffhand 停用時，手持此處定義的物品會隱藏副手。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>以下 GIF 展示手持火把或不死圖騰時隱藏副手的效果：</strong><br></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hide-hands/a.webp\" alt=\"gif0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"446\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，你可自由在任何模組包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請至 <a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 儲存庫</a>。感謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
